sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Student
    actor B as Teacher
    participant INT as STOMP interceptor (/ws)
    participant CC as ChatController
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant BR as Message broker
    A->>INT: CONNECT with Authorization Bearer JWT
    INT-->>A: CONNECTED (ERROR if the token is invalid)
    A->>BR: SUBSCRIBE /topic/rooms/general
    B->>BR: SUBSCRIBE /topic/rooms/general
    A->>CC: SEND /app/chat/general
    CC->>DB: persist message (room, sender, role)
    CC->>BR: publish to /topic/rooms/general
    BR-->>A: MESSAGE
    BR-->>B: MESSAGE
    Note over A,B: history: GET /api/v1/chat/rooms/{room}/messages (last 100)
